{{Infobox_Item|title=Xeno|image=XenoEffect.png|type=<span style="color:#FFFFFF">Effect</span>|rarity=[[Common Weapons|<span style="color:magenta;">Godly</span>]]|obtain=[[Halloween Event 2025]] - Buying the [[Xenotech Bundle]]|theme=godly}}'''Xeno''' is an [[effect]] that is obtainable by purchasing the [[Xenotech Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux in the Halloween Event 2025.

== Appearance ==
The effect surrounds the knife with a purple electrical aura along a purple glow. When a victim is killed with this effect, their body will emit purple lightnings. 

== Trivia ==

* This effect alongside it's weapon counterparts were originally red before being changed to purple not long after.
